title: Application
description: The Next.js app. Routes render the interface; the libraries under it talk to Supabase and Stripe.
connects:
  - to: supabase
    label: Auth, data, Realtime
    description: Every request a person or an agent makes goes to Supabase as the signed-in user, so row-level security decides what can be read and written. Only billing, deleting an account, and removing a deleted workspace's files use a secret key. Documents sync over Supabase Realtime and are stored as Yjs updates in Postgres.
ignore:
  - hooks
